    `s 790C(6) both answers hold`
        `s 790B(1) this Part applies to the company` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A company to which this Part applies" (a JUST FALSE from s 790B(1) flows through)
        (IF    `the company knows or has cause to believe that a person is a registrable person or a registrable relevant legal entity in relation to the company`
